    "stdout": "T009 : ∀ (n : ℕ) (E : Set (GPEucl n)),\n  ((∀ (k : ℕ) (x : GPEucl k) (t : ℝ), GPhead (GPappend x t) = x ∧ (GPappend x t).ofLp (Fin.last k) = t) ∧\n      (∀ (k : ℕ) (z : GPEucl (k + 1)), GPappend (GPhead z) (z.ofLp (Fin.last k)) = z) ∧\n        (∀ (k : ℕ) (x y : GPEucl k) (t u : ℝ), dist (GPappend x t) (GPappend y u) = √(dist x y ^ 2 + |t - u| ^ 2)) ∧\n          ∀ (k : ℕ) (z w : GPEucl (k + 1)),\n            dist (GPhead z) (GPhead w) ≤ dist z w ∧ |z.ofLp (Fin.last k) - w.ofLp (Fin.last k)| ≤ dist z w) →\n    (1 ≤ n →\n        ∀ (q r ε : ℝ),\n          dimH E < ENNReal.ofReal q →\n            0 < r →\n              r ≤ 1 →\n                0 < ε →\n                  ∃ U,\n                    GPcover E r U ∧\n                      (∀ (i : ℕ), (U i).Nonempty → 0 < Metric.ediam (U i)) ∧ GPcost q U < ENNReal.ofReal ε) →\n      1 ≤ n →\n        ∀ (q r ε : ℝ),\n          dimH E < ENNReal.ofReal q →\n            0 < r →\n              r ≤ 1 →\n                0 < ε → ∃ W, GPcover (GPproduct E) (√2 * r) W ∧ GPcost (q + 1) W < ENNReal.ofReal (2 * √2 ^ (q + 1) * ε)\n'Translation.T009' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\n",
